    "principal_scope": [
      "Theorem1.1 complete q>=4 classification with corrected equivalence counts",
      "Propositions5.3,5.8,5.12,Tables1,5,6,7: existence,exhaustion,conjugacy/Aut counts,diagrams,local arc depth,RPRI and IP2",
      "Remark4.3 eleven E16 classes in PSL2(64),analytic scalar-subspace proof",
      "q2 andq3 boundary clarified"
    ],
    "new_proof_ideas": [
      "Primitive abelian normal images uniformly reduce both Borel and dihedral local actions.",
      "Subgroup and index bounds leave exactly14 small fields; one actual-intersection algorithm covers all of them.",
      "Literal type-swap transports distinguish ordered and unordered conjugacy.",
      "Scalar stabilizer field gives the eleven-class auxiliary count without a group census."
    ],
    "retained_inputs": [
      "Dickson subgroup alternatives and classical maximal-subgroup/natural-subfield clauses; not the original geometry tables",
      "Standard PSL2/PGL2 orders and projective action",
      "GAP exact finite-group/subgroup/double-coset/automorphism algorithms for the14 explicit fields"
    ],
    "qualifications": [
      "Two D12-D12 ordered classes atq11,13 merge under the source unordered convention.",
      "Correct the split index repeated onp188, the omitted denominator2 in odd nonsplit Table3, and D16 vertex count153 atq17.",
      "Replace the invalid unqualified prime-reflection clause of Table4 by the proved local-action lemma.",
      "Lemma2.1 is used/reproved only in rank two; no higher-rank strong-Boolean equivalence acquired.",
      "Earlier named Petersen/Desargues/Perkel identifications are context, not new priority claims.",
      "Original question/source history beyond the fixed edition has not been searched.",
      "Unused numerical subgroup multiplicities and other local actions in source Lemma4.1/Table4 are not newly certified; only the stated classical alternatives/maximality interfaces are retained. The novel E16 multiplicity is proved explicitly."
    ],
